{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","title":"Social Investment","description":"Proses pengurangan narsisme melalui pengambilan peran sosial dan adaptasi.","tags":["psychology","social-investment","maturity"],"custom":{"description":"Proses pengurangan narsisme melalui pengambilan peran sosial dan adaptasi."},"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"2052897d15d44f3fc0a94c58a2f01478","updated":1782198659103,"created":1782198659103,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.social-investment","alias":"social-investment","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.social-investment"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.maturity","alias":"maturity","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.maturity"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-investment","id":"notes.psychology.social-investment","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":11,"offset":816},"end":{"line":15,"column":58,"offset":863},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":11,"offset":1468},"end":{"line":22,"column":49,"offset":1506},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-investment"}],"anchors":{"social-investment":{"type":"header","text":"Social Investment","value":"social-investment","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"definition":{"type":"header","text":"Definition","value":"definition","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"how-it-reduces-narcissism":{"type":"header","text":"How it Reduces Narcissism","value":"how-it-reduces-narcissism","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"social-investment\">Social Investment<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-investment\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"social-investment-1\">Social Investment<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-investment-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"definition\">Definition<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#definition\"></a></h2>\n<p><em>Social Investment</em> adalah proses \"menaruh modal diri\" (perhatian, tanggung jawab, komitmen) ke dalam relasi dan struktur sosial dengan mengambil peran tertentu (misal: sebagai pasangan, orang tua, rekan kerja, atau pemimpin).</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-reduces-narcissism\">How it Reduces Narcissism<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#how-it-reduces-narcissism\"></a></h2>\n<p>Pengambilan peran sosial memaksa individu untuk bergeser dari pertanyaan <em>\"Gue mau apa?\"</em> menjadi <em>\"Apa yang orang lain butuh dari gue dalam peran ini?\"</em>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Uji Ego</strong>: Peran sosial menguji perilaku ego. Misalnya, kebiasaan menghilang saat konflik tidak bisa bertahan dalam relasi jangka panjang atau lingkungan kerja profesional.</li>\n<li><strong>Kesadaran Dampak</strong>: Individu belajar bahwa perilakunya memiliki efek nyata terhadap orang lain.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Social investment mengajarkan bahwa diri gue punya dampak.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">social-investment (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">maturity (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enabl